<title>USA: Hutchinson Q4 hurt by low demand, increased costs.</title>
<headline>Hutchinson Q4 hurt by low demand, increased costs.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Technology Inc said Monday its fiscal quarter and full year earnings were hurt by reduced demand, increased overhead resulting from added manufacturing capacity, and higher costs related to accelerated product development.</p>
<p>The company's fiscal 1996 fourth quarter was a 14-week period, compared to 13 weeks last year.</p>
<p>Hutchinson supplies suspension assemblies for disk drives.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
